@dc:title "Phenotyping vocabulary bundle"
@dc:description "Closes the vocabulary so sibling-disjointness axioms get generated."
vocabulary bundle <http://www.example.com/phenotype/vocabulary-bundle#> as v-bundle {
    includes <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> as dc
    includes <http://www.example.com/phenotype/vocabulary#>
}
